%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% divergence: sampled-function-short-source
% expect-error: rangecheck
% Scenario: a sampled function with a short source. A type 0 function
% declares four samples of eight bits with one output but its
% DataSource holds three bytes, so the shading using it raises
% rangecheck.
<< /ShadingType 2 /ColorSpace /DeviceGray /Coords [0 0 100 0]
   /Function << /FunctionType 0 /Domain [0 1] /Range [0 1] /Size [4]
     /BitsPerSample 8 /DataSource <0040ff> >> >> shfill
